      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一位特雷森学园的学生呆呆地盯着天空。\n我想她应该在做日光浴，于是默默地走过她身边──",
      "source_fingerprint": "e620d3d2ad37f372619e25928721220f829355ff88d66b47a786368d2eab8bdf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
